.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
# Every example stays tracked: it names the keys with placeholders, never a value.
!.env.example
# The real deploy configuration (project, region, model, resource names): never committed (06-CONTEXT D-03, D-08).
# deploy/releases/ is not ignored: release manifests are committed to this private repo (D-11).
# The release lock (06-REVIEWS R2-11): ignored so the clean-tree check passes while a release or rollback holds it.
deploy/.release.lock
# Drill records (deploy/README.md step 11) name the project and its resources: they stay local, never committed.
deploy/releases-drill/
deploy/.env.local
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
data/reference/reports/forecast-diagnostics.json
test-results/
# FreshRetailNet files, generated artifacts and the data-pipeline environment never enter git (05.2 D-06, D-07)
public-data/
.venv-data/
